The base classes (combustionModel, CombustionModel, ThermoCombustion) are NOT copied here: they come from
OpenFOAM's own libcombustionModels, which this library links against. Earlier versions compiled unmodified
copies of them into this library; that defined their static objects twice and caused a double free at
exit (the malloc_consolidate / exit 134 crash after every parallel run). Do not add copies back.

FGM/FGM contains the wrapper and selector, it reads combustionProperties.FGMCoeffs and selects model.

To add your own solver, copy one of the existing solvers and rename all files and class names to YOURSOLVERNAME

Make sure to include the header YOURSOLVERNAME.H in FGM/FGM/FGM.H

and make sure to add FGM/YOURSOLVERNAME/YOURSOLVERNAMEs.C to Make/files


